# ASK-Team — generated indexes are not tracked in git.
# Every INDEX.md is an aggregate view regenerated by `python askctl.py index`
# and is not the source of truth (SoT = the frontmatter in each item file).
# Untracked by git → zero concurrent-edit conflicts, zero stale state.
#
# This file lives inside the AGENTSPECKIT/ folder, so patterns are relative to that folder.

workitems/INDEX.md
conflicts/INDEX.md
team/INDEX.md
sessions/INDEX.md
history/INDEX.md
assumptions/INDEX.md
notes/INDEX.md
SOURCES/INDEX.md

# Session scratch (optional): track active sessions, but to ignore local temp files uncomment below
# sessions/*.local.md
